，基本可以锁定绝对顶部区域，底部却只能判断阶段底部区域", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "顶部基本从价格可以看见，比如ppi通胀一直上升，对企业生产和消费抑制，那么到达一个顶部极限后，央行加息，就开始坍塌式回落，不会说回落一点点又创下新高。\n而底部机制影响因素就多了，比如价格，收入，利率，库存，债务，政策等，可能价格下降到一定程度，需求回升，但是受其他因素影响，底部可能再次下探。\n也就是顶部，基本可以锁定绝对顶部区域，底部却只能判断阶段底部区域", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "11579-11633", "createTime": 1792414905, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "426066534_8cYt6YhQm", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1792415103, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}, {"reviewId": "17784386_8aFEvd9ql", "review": {"abstract": "经济周期的顶部、底部机制是不同的，顶部从来都是一个系统性问题，因此易于预测。但底部从来都不是一个系统性问题，", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "抄底经常会抄在半山腰，底部比顶部更难预测。高手往往是在抄底中被击溃。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "11579-11633", "createTime": 1784302907, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "17784386_8aFEvd9ql", "userVid": 17784386, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305",