0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "12206-12240", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "87149437_8ae7h5CGB", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "老美滞胀，东大通缩。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "12206-12240", "abstract": "而且，每个国家在货币政策的使用到达穷尽之后，都面临着通缩或滞胀等问题", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "87149437_8ae7h5CGB", "userVid": 87149437, "topics": [], "createTime": 1782738859, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 87149437, "name": "心有千千结", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0011-vsMikFs36Nktz8qo0sXvLc8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "心有千千结", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "物来顺应", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "79308323_88HoXZIse", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "当经济陷入严重衰退或通缩时，央行通常会采取降息、降准等常规手段来刺激经济。但这个过程有一个天然的物理极限——利率不能无限降低。一旦政策利率降到零（或接近零），传统的价格工具就失效了，央行丧失了进一步宽松的常规空间，这就是所谓的 “零利率下限”。当货币政策无力进一步扩张总需求时，经济的最终结果通常取决于供给侧的冲击和结构，具体表现为通缩或滞胀。\n\n1. 通缩（需求不足的恶性循环）\n\n这是最典型的结局。当货币政策失效时，需求持续疲软，导致企业降价、裁员，居民收入下降，预期悲观，进一步推迟消费和投资，形成“需求萎缩 → 物价下跌 → 实际债务加重 → 进一步抑制需求”的通缩螺旋。典型案例就是日本“失去的三十年”（1990年代至今），即使利率为零并实施大规模QE，依然难以摆脱间歇性的通缩压力。\n\n2. 滞胀（供给冲击下的两难）\n\n另一种情况是，货币政策虽然失效，但经济并非只有需求不足。如果此时发生严重的供给端冲击（如能源危机、地缘冲突、供应链断裂、粮食减产），导致生产成本急剧上升，就会同时推高物价并抑制产出，形成“高通胀 + 高失业 + 低增长”的滞胀格局。此时央行陷入两难：加息遏制通胀会加剧衰退；不加息则通胀失控。典型案例是1970年代的石油危机。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "而且，每个国家在货币政策的使用到达穷尽之后，都面临着通缩或滞胀等问题", "range": "12206-12240", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "79308323_88HoXZIse", "userVid": 79308323, "topics": [], "createTime": 1777359046, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 79308323, "name": "浮游世间", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q3auHgzwzM5xHHjMLLdDkUHNbjaf72sq3xIicTOW2hq3hPVibpjWjx2uVmWJ8GzOWt0DiaKQK7bf1dibFCXMoewjSrXOOGkTS0lc/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "浮游世间", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 11, "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "12279-12552", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 3, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "223635575_8chxe2EJ3", "review": {"abstract": "一方面，我们对未来3～5年中周期繁荣的出现并不悲观；但另一方面，这个繁荣又是短暂而不确定的（见图6-7）。\n[插图]", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 11, "content": "可以这么理解，长波衰退期的后半场斜率放缓。虽然中周期上升段主导，但受长周期力量抵消，且中周期下降段与长波衰退叠加。所以繁荣的时间短暂而不确定。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "12279-12332", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "223635575_8chxe2EJ3", "userVid": 223635575, "topics": [], "createTime": 1789976264, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "237554720_89J8XrGDY", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "中周期不是9-10年么\n\n我的gpt说\n周金涛当时认为：大家正站在谷底 且基钦和中周期互相嵌套\n“未来3-5年会迎来繁荣”这句话意思是再爬3-5年能接近小山顶\n\n总体来看中周期向上 但长波仍然向下", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "一方面，我们对未来3～5年中周期繁荣的出现并不悲观；但另一方面，这个繁荣又是短暂而不确定的（见图6-7）​。", "range": "12279-12332", "chapterName": "06 